[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708153564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-2708153564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":2708153564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hayTc","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T08:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T08:58:14Z","body":"Looks like a potential duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/64296","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708153564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708926485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-2708926485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":2708926485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdvAV","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T15:50:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T15:54:09Z","body":"> Looks like a potential duplicate of [#64296](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/64296)\n\nok\n\n> This is likely a Wayland limitation for security reasons. Wayland has a much stricter security model compared to X11, which leads to more limitations (many of them still being unresolved as of 2022).\n\nmaybe we can display a warning that this feature is not supported\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708926485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725272541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-2725272541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":2725272541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6icFvd","user":{"login":"olivergs","id":1439905,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Mzk5MDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1439905?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs","html_url":"https://github.com/olivergs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olivergs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T17:07:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T17:07:46Z","body":"Also we can document a workaround example recipe like:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nconst MOUSE_MOVE_SPEED = 10\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_HIDDEN\n\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar pos = get_window().get_mouse_position()\n\tvar vector = Input.get_vector(&\"ui_left\", &\"ui_right\", &\"ui_up\", &\"ui_down\")\n\t\n\tif vector != Vector2.ZERO:\n\t\tvar display_size = DisplayServer.window_get_size() # get_viewport().get_visible_rect().size\n\t\tpos += vector * MOUSE_MOVE_SPEED\n\t\tpos.x = max(min(pos.x, display_size.x - 1), 0)\n\t\tpos.y = max(min(pos.y, display_size.y - 1), 0)\n\t\tInput.warp_mouse(pos)\n\t$FakeCursor.position = pos\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725272541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803767828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-4803767828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":4803767828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHlOuFA","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T20:13:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T20:16:50Z","body":"Hi, what compositor are you using? Can you still reproduce this? If you're *not* using hyprland, kwin or mutter, could you give #120647 a shot?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4803767828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960432770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-4960432770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":4960432770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6oygg","user":{"login":"mrcdk","id":483531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzUzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/483531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk","html_url":"https://github.com/mrcdk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrcdk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T16:52:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T16:52:19Z","body":"@deralmas It still doesn't work with the code from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issue-2903993614. \n\nI have the `wp_pointer_warp_v1` protocol available. Checked it by running `wayland-info | grep wp_pointer_warp_v1` \n\nGodot also detects it. Running `WAYLAND_DEBUG=1 path/to/godot --display-driver wayland 2>&1 | grep wp_pointer_warp_v1` I can see that the pointer warp is working but `get_window().get_mouse_position()` returns the old non-warped value.\n\nUsing this code:\n\n```gd\nextends Node\n\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif Input.is_action_just_pressed(&\"ui_left\"):\n\t\tInput.warp_mouse(Vector2(100, 100))\n\tif Input.is_action_just_pressed(&\"ui_right\"):\n\t\tprint(get_window().get_mouse_position())\n```\n\nIf you press right it prints the current mouse position. Then if you press left the mouse will warp to 100, 100. If you press right again it will still print the old mouse position.\n\n\nTested this version using kwin:\n\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (2cd047c26) - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 04 Jul 2026 20:54:12 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (nvidia; 610.43.03) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 61.90 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n```\nOperating System: Manjaro Linux \nKDE Plasma Version: 6.6.6\nKDE Frameworks Version: 6.27.0\nQt Version: 6.11.1\nKernel Version: 7.1.3-1-MANJARO (64-bit)\nGraphics Platform: Wayland\n\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4960432770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4961263548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103777#issuecomment-4961263548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103777","id":4961263548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ7bfvA","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T18:27:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T18:27:34Z","body":"Good catch! I did some research and I think it's some \"blind spot\" of the base protocol: unlike [`wl_pointer.motion`](https://wayland.app/protocols/wayland#wl_pointer:event:motion), [`wl_pointer.button`](https://wayland.app/protocols/wayland#wl_pointer:event:button) events don't report the pointer position.\n\nLuckily this is being addressed as we speak. Wayland 1.26 RC1 ([Mailing list annoucement](https://lore.freedesktop.org/wayland-devel/-Ppab1BlrXbXvKwok-5WA3ohwqMovJGchqsCmF7qFdoDznIykeyly1AyQQMub66aLExGGDZNNHSG6h5MQpY2EzFc0c_32wItTwTFDdtAZnA=@emersion.fr/T/#u)) includes a new `wl_pointer.warp` ([!340](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland/-/merge_requests/340)) event that's supposed to be fixing this and many other edge cases (e.g. windows changing under the pointer).\n\nSee also kwin MR [!9004](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/9004). I don't know if there's any specific blocker but I guess that it has to wait *at least* for Wayland 1.26 to come out as stable.\n\nI'm still thinking on the best solution to handle this. We could add a workaround for compositors that don't support the new warp event (it's possible to query that), but I would have to see how other compositors react to your MRP to avoid breaking those. I'm also curious about how legacy warping behaves.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4961263548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]